[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4645835326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120073#issuecomment-4645835326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120073","id":4645835326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFOnSPg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T05:56:02Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T05:56:02Z","body":"Please include hardware info (GPU, I assume it is Intel Mac) and crash report from `Console.app` (in `Applications` → `Utilities`). Is it reproducible with previous 4.6.x versions?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4645835326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4646595741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120073#issuecomment-4646595741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120073","id":4646595741,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFPVsnQ","user":{"login":"Sehomtselith","id":180614074,"node_id":"U_kgDOCsPzug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180614074?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sehomtselith","html_url":"https://github.com/Sehomtselith","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sehomtselith/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sehomtselith/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sehomtselith/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sehomtselith/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sehomtselith/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sehomtselith/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sehomtselith/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sehomtselith/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sehomtselith/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T08:03:55Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T08:03:55Z","body":"<img width=\"272\" height=\"165\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/925a2375-ba3d-4b8a-aa88-2dfda66393c8\" />\n\nI cut off the serial number, assuming thats not critical info.\n\nTheres a lot of info in the crash report how much is relevant, and is there any sensitive data in there?\n\nOf the information I found in the crash report:\n\nLocal CPU: 0\nError Code:      0x02000148 \nTrap Number:     133\n\nTo more robustly describe what I'm experiencing on the application side, when I click to open a project, either through the godot app, or to open it by opening the .godot file of a project in any of the 4.6 version, it promptly crashes the application, without successfully opening the project updating the version of the project file.\n\nThe following pictures are of my most recent project file AFTER a crash, having attempted to open them in 4.6.1 (the full screenshot), and in 4.6.3 (the cropped picture)\n\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"800\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4bcb2c7-0bdc-4f2f-975a-f517a509b8c0\" />\n\n<img width=\"961\" height=\"77\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33595289-a08d-46dc-83e3-a072cc24bb0e\" />\n\nThose photos are mostly in case the fact that the file isn't updating with the new system version is relevant.\n\nWhen I open with recovery mode, it lets me view the contents of the project as expected, and does update the version of the file (see below) but it still crashes the project as soon as I try to open the file to edit it.\n\n<img width=\"972\" height=\"79\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d41ad3c-77d2-4a8f-8bb1-dee517040360\" />\n\nThis photo was taken after opening that project in 4.6.3, with recovery mode, showing the version of the file updating to 4.6, but not solving the crash issue.\n\nI've checked with the 4.6. (0, 1, 2, and 3) stable versions and this crash result is consistent across all of them.\n\nI am currently continuing my project in 4.5.2, as I am not experiencing crashes in that version.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4646595741/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4673555255","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120073#issuecomment-4673555255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120073","id":4673555255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFpDLNw","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T19:09:20Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T19:09:20Z","body":"> Theres a lot of info in the crash report how much is relevant, and is there any sensitive data in there?\n\nRelevant part is stack traces between: `Thread 0::` and `Binary Images:` of crash reports, it should not contain any sensitive data (paths and username should be outside this part and already automatically replaced with `*`).\n\nAre your projects using Forward+/Mobile or Compatibility renderer? Project Manager always use Compatibility, so if it's not crashing, but projects are, it might be GPU/renderer related.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4673555255/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]